Unique Event System: How about a cup of Forgetful Tea at Granny Meng’s Tea House? Or maybe helping a shy ghost with her request? 10 regular events and 90 special events make every Mahjong journey full of surprises. Your actions and choices in these events will have a significant impact on the subsequent battles.
Diverse Boss Battles: Accompanying you on each journey through the underworld are 24 unique bosses, including Granny Meng, Ox-Head and Horse-Face, and the Four Judges. Each boss has their own active and passive skills. Study them to find your path to victory! Whether you lose to them or defeat them, special animations will celebrate the moment!",0
