Out in the Field – Enjoy riding your monsties in an open world built like an outdoor adventure course, ready to test the limits of your riding actions. Change Monsties on the fly, letting you easily swap through your party for riding actions like flying and wall climbing. Use actions like ranged and melee attacks on nearby monsters to gain an advantage before battle even starts.
