DYNAMIC TEAM AI – Competition within the F1 paddock is fierce, with all eyes on the future. Keep your stars happy to avoid allowing rivals from poaching your talent, disrupting your team’s trajectory towards the top.
AFFILIATE DRIVERS – Build a legacy by fostering talents from F2 & F3 to add to your own affiliate pool. Access the stars of the future and ensure their success is your success.
