Customize every corner of your hotel! Set up themed zones, install amenities, and choose from a wide selection of furnishings, wallpaper, and flooring to create a five-star atmosphere that’s uniquely yours.
Impress and Advance
Every detail matters. Hospitality reviewers will scrutinize every room, every meal, every stay. Earn glowing ratings to attract wealthier guests and expand your growing hotel empire.
Expand Your Hotel Empire to Global Heights
Expand your hotel empire across multiple locations across the globe, each with their own unique character and challenges. Some sites will come with existing structures to build on, while others are blank slates waiting for you to make your mark.
Manage Staff and Contractors
Recruit and train a capable team to keep your hotel running smoothly. Each employee has unique attributes that influence their performance, and they’ll grow and level up as they gain experience! Balance staff levels with guest needs, and coordinate with contractors to manage supplies, restock pantries, and keep every room spotless.
Welcome Your Guests
Adapt as demanding guests, special events, and unpredictable situations keep you on your toes. Meet expectations or brace yourself for the reviews!",0
