NEW TO FACTORY GAMES – Build & automate shape factories; Beginner friendly; No pressure or penalties; Proceed at your own pace; Great tutorial; Perfect introduction to the genre.
FACTORY GAME VETERAN – Solve automation & logistic challenges; Build huge automated factories; 100% focus on factory building; No enemies or building costs; Min-max your factory layouts; Explore tons of complex mechanics.
IF YOU PLAYED SHAPEZ 1 – Trains & fluids; Multi-layer factories; Manufacture Mode; New mechanics & hexagonal shapes; Blueprint library; Better performance and better visuals.
