Take on the role of Tonio and manage the family pizzeria inherited from your grandfather. Experience the full scope of running a restaurant business: from shopping for ingredients, to doing prep work and finally making a real Italian pizza! It’s up to you to rise to the top or go bankrupt and shame your family.
