SIDE A – One hour. The woman and her team of investigators had one hour to infiltrate a prison and cause a breakout. Her dearest hope was that, among the prisoners, there would be her brother who disappeared nearly twenty years ago. She couldn’t shake the feeling that something sinister was waiting for her team.
