That’s exactly what happens to Devon, an aspiring game developer who, after a string of failed projects, is tricked by an evil magician and trapped in a whimsical world made entirely of clay.
In Unblock, you’ll guide Devon through a series of intricate, pseudo-isometric platforming challenges. What’s pseudo-isometric, you ask? Although the camera angle doesn’t strictly follow traditional isometric standards, we’ve adjusted the perspective and depth to achieve a similar look and feel. Each level is a handcrafted puzzle, filled with clever obstacles, hidden secrets, and charming details that bring the clay-crafted world to life.
Jump, run, fall and think your way through vibrant environments, all while uncovering the story of Devon’s journey and the magician’s sinister moves. With its unique visual style, secret areas, and rage game mechanics, Unblock offers a delightful yet challenging experience for the most hardcore platformer fans and casual gamers alike.
Will you help Devon escape the cubic realm and reclaim his ordinary life?
