Choose your own style! You can select one between more than 40 different skins with all kinds of styles and colors, from simple color swaps to chakra-expanding morphing lasers, and even a few loosely inspired by classic video game characters. Completing all the Achievements will even give you access to some skins that will increase the difficulty level of the game.
