Reinforcement in the Hideout – If you lose a battle, you lose progress and return to your hideout, but that doesn’t mean a complete reset. You can unlock permanent reinforcement in hiding places, discover new artifacts, or find ways to speed up your next exploration.
Branches of Exploration – The environment and enemies encountered in each expedition may vary, but the castle structure is fixed. You may also be able to find a new path in the castle. And you will have to choose your move of direction every time you encounter the next node.
