Game Features

FIGHT USING LIGHT – Your only means of defense will be light. Don’t let Millie’s lamp go out; use it to illuminate your path, solve puzzles, and fend off otherworldly beings. But remember, the lamp’s flame is not endless; spend too much, and you risk being forever engulfed in darkness!
BEWARE OF MONSTERS – In Beyond The Darkness, real monsters lie in wait for you, thirsting to destroy any glimmer of hope and drag Millie into the abyss of despair. Each of them is a reflection of childhood fears, ready to attack as soon as you turn away from them.
