Guide your people through the eras of human discovery – Nurture your people’s brilliance and invention as you progress your Nation through twelve  unique Technology Eras, making the hard choices about where to focus your Nation’s greatest minds. As you near the end of each Era, you’ll have to decide how fast to push your scientists along the path to the future – at the risk of the present.
