Players can adjust settings such as brightness in the game, graphic and sound quality, as well as configure keys to their needs or create shortcuts. For example, you can assign a key shortcut to the number 4 on the keyboard for a particular item such as a medkit and during the game press the 4 key to use the medkit. Additionally, there are crates in the game that can be destroyed. The game supports various control methods, including both mouse and keyboard, as well as gamepad, to provide optimal gameplay comfort for everyone. Unforgettable experiences are enriched by terrifying music, and players can strive to achieve special challenges through the Steam achievements system and compete with others on leaderboards thanks to the Steam Leaderboards feature and use Steam Cloud saves.
