SYNERGY SYSTEM
Your creatures work best together. You can create synergies between them. Each synergy that a creature has, will activate an extra ability or modify your creature.
TRAITS
Go on expeditions after statues of Draknar, the god of creatures, so that your creatures receive traits that make them unique.
SPECIAL ABILITIES
