This makes it hard for our Hero to be taken seriously when he tries to save a town that’s mysteriously sinking into the ground, even if he is the only one capable of saving it!
Will you be the One True Hero this kingdom needs?
Game Features

Nerve-Racking Sword Fights: All sorts of terrible evil creatures will stand in your path. You’re going to have to deal with them if you want to save the kingdom!
Loads of Platforming: Who knew there was so much jumping involved in being a legendary hero?
A Tale to Remember: Meet a cast of memorable characters, explore dungeons, solve puzzles and unravel the mystery of the sinking town before it disappears off the face of the earth!",0
