BECOME AN EXTREMELY POWERFUL DRAGON: You’re born a dragon that has much to learn but destined to be as powerful as the ancients. You’ll learn to attack, jump, fly, swim, and breathe fire, poison and lightning. As you gain experience you will level up and become completely unstoppable.
