Jump, dash, roll and run with a unique movement system as you progress into the games and unfold the truth that lies behind evasilix!
Game Features

A new way to play: In Evasilix, you will control your character differently from what you can be used to in other games. On the left side of your screen, you will see various buttons that you can interact with your keyboard, each button representing one movement.
The movements control works in 2 steps: This system allows to have a unique learning progression from level to level, putting your skill and your adaptation at test from easy (in the first levels) to hard (in the last levels).
