More than 25 distinctive levels: In Evasilix, you will face more than 25 levels that will test you and challenge you all through your progression into the game! Those levels include parkours, boss and even train levels! Each level is unique and has its own layer.It is in those levels that you will put your movements to use and where you will unlock them as things progress. And don’t worry if you are stuck in one level, you can always go to another from the same area to change your mind and come back later to it.
